                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill Act delivers for rural hospitals and health care providers. It provides $50 billion to rural hospitals over the next five years.\n\nNebraska specifically will see a minimum of $100 million a year in support to rural hospitals.\n\nThis important legislation supports Nebraskans and Americans living in rural areas by supporting their hospitals and health care facilities.",
