                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today I\u2019m celebrating the inaugural National Rural Health Day! Over 68% of hospitals in Nebraska are in rural areas. Ensuring all Nebraskans have access to care is critical.\n\nThe One Big Beautiful Bill champions rural health care. The bill includes the Rural Health Transformation (RHT) program. The RHT program will improve healthcare access. It will provide sustainability so our rural communities can thrive for years to come. I am committed to supporting the goals and ideals of rural communities. They are the backbone of Nebraska. We\u2019re supporting the quality healthcare they deserve.",
                "text_lang": "en",
